#: lib/tuist_web/marketing/controllers/marketing_controller.ex:1016
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Per minute of job time, from when your CI provider starts the job until it finishes, with no rounding up to whole minutes. Machine boot and cleanup are not billed. Every plan includes 100 free macOS minutes and 2,500 free Linux minutes a month, counted on a 2 vCPU / 8 GB Linux machine, and 100 GB of cache volume storage, with storage beyond that at $0.10 per GB-month. Yearly commitments and higher usage get discounts. Contact us at contact@tuist.dev to set up yearly or volume pricing."
